stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Idle
  Idle --> Placing : start session (album folder chosen)
  Placing --> Scanning : "Scan" pressed
  Scanning --> Detecting : image received
  Scanning --> Error : device busy / not found
  Detecting --> Reviewing : regions proposed
  Reviewing --> Reviewing : add / delete / adjust / rotate region (Command, undo)
  Reviewing --> Saving : "Accept"
  Reviewing --> Placing : "Rescan"
  Saving --> Placing : "Next photos"
  Saving --> Finishing : "Done"
  Finishing --> Exporting : export target chosen
  Finishing --> [*] : no export
  Exporting --> [*]
  Error --> Placing : retry
  Error --> [*] : cancel
